serro/Documents/dev/n/agent/experiments/skillplane, rollout_path=/Users/serro/.codex/sessions/2026/08/06/rollout-2026-08-06T21-03-37-019fd7b5-6803-7fa3-b0e5-bdff4c86c507.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-07T14:03:37+00:00, thread_id=019fd7b5-6803-7fa3-b0e5-bdff4c86c507, separate clean worktree implementation and full release gate)\n"
